  "idea": "Greenshot: lightweight screenshot utility with instant annotation tools",
  "text": "The simplest screenshot tool for creating step-by-step tutorial guides. Onboarding new team members with long blocks of text creates confusion and constant follow-up questions. Standard screenshot tools lack dedicated tutorial annotations, forcing you into clumsy graphics programs for simple callouts. Greenshot captures your screen instantly, auto-increments numbered step badges, and highlights critical UI elements with one click. You build crystal-clear standard operating procedures in sixty seconds.",
